    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 186 (Thursday, November 9, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. McCAUL:\nH.R. 6349.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle 1, Section 8 of the U.S. Constitution.\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo prohibit or require notification with respect to certain\nactivities of United States persons involving countries of\nconcern.\n[Page H5671]\n</pre>",
